---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agricultural Resources by Country | GoOrganicAfrica
description: Browse GoOrganicAfrica agricultural finance, grants and machinery resources across 54 African countries.
permalink: "/agriculture-resources/countries/"
---
{% include "partials/language-selectors/static.njk" %}
<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:1100px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.eyebrow">Farmer Resources</span>
    <h1 data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.title">Agricultural Resources by Country</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.intro">Explore the GoOrganicAfrica directory across all 54 target African country markets. Each country has a dedicated page; country-specific records are added only after official sources are verified.</p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:30px;">
      {% for country in directoryCountryCoverage.countries %}
        <a class="ebook-card" href="/agricultural-resources/countries/{{ country.code | lower }}/" style="text-decoration:none;">
          <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;">{{ country.name }}</h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
            {% if country.coverage_status == "source_registered" %}
              <span data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.statusSourceRegistered">Source registered</span>
            {% elif country.coverage_status == "active_monitoring" %}
              <span data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.statusActiveMonitoring">Active monitoring</span>
            {% else %}
              <span data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.statusNeedsReview">Country source review needed</span>
            {% endif %}
          </p>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/agriculture-resources/" data-i18n="static.countryDirectory.back">← Back to Resources</a></p>
  </div>
</section>